SUMMARY:SABOR TRADICIONAL Bachata Social
DESCRIPTION:If you love Traditional Bachata\, the roots\, the rhythm\, the feeling. This night is for YOU. \nWe are bringing to you our NEW bi-monthly Traditional Bachata social to Ashkenaz in Berkeley —→ “ SABOR TRADICIONAL “ \nA bimonthly event held on the 4th Friday:\nFeb. 27 / Apr. 24 / Jun. 26 /\nAug. 28 / Oct. 23 / Dec. TBA \nJoin us on February 27 for the grand opening of this Social. \nFor this special night we are celebrating Dominican Independence Day with nothing but pure\, traditional bachata all night long. Expect classic rhythms\, deep connection\, and that unmistakable Dominican sabor ( Flavor ) \n*** Doors open 7:30pm\n*** Traditional Bachata Lesson\n*** Social Dancing 9:00pm- 1:00am\n*** Performances 10:30pm \nTickets\nAdvance: $16 ( Sales end Thu Feb. 26 11:59pm )\nDay of show: $25\nStudent: $15 at the door with Valid 2026 school ID \nASHKENAZ\n1317 San Pablo Ave Berkeley\, CA \nParking is available in the REI parking lot across the street after 9 pm. At other times\, street parking is available on Gilman\, San Pablo and neighboring streets. Please respect Ashkenaz’s neighbors and keep voices down as you walk through the neighborhood\, especially late at night. \nFOR MORE INFO CONTACT krdance.official@gmail.com
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/sabor-tradicional-bachata-social/2026-04-24/
LOCATION:Ashkenaz\, 1317 San Pablo Ave\, Berkeley\, CA\, 94702\, United States
CATEGORIES:San Francisco
END:VEVENT
